    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1104">

                <pb facs="0934" n="818" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg818"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/16672.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Douglas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-02T22:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 2, 1915—10 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Villa, repulsed last night, preparing for another attack this afternoon. Many
                    bullets crossed line last night and several wounded on this side. Am convinced
                    both sides exerting every effort not fire over boundary line.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carothers.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
